    "flavor_text": "They carry people and Pokémon,\nbut the wind can catch them, so\nthere can’t be a fixed destination.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "white-2",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/22/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It carries people and Pokémon when it flies.\nBut since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "x",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It’s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in\nbig groups. No one knows where they go.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "y",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It carries people and Pokémon when it flies.\nBut since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "omega-ruby",
