      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It appears as if from nowhere—muttering\nincantations, placing curses, and giving\npeople terrifying visions.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "sun",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Mismagius have been known to cast spells to\nmake people fall in love, so some people search\nfor this Pokémon as if their life depended on it.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "moon",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Feared for its wrath and the curses it spreads,\nthis Pokémon will also, on a whim, cast spells\nthat help people.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "ultra-sun",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Its muttered curses can cause awful headaches\nor terrifying visions that torment others.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "ultra-moon",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "The incantations Mismagius chants can ward against misfortune,\nso a custom exists of inviting it into one's home. Incur the\nPokémon's displeasure, however, and disaster will surely ensue.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "legends-arceus",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/39/"
    }
  }
]

