    "flavor_text": "It resembles an illustration published in a paranormal magazine, said to be a depiction of a super-ancient Suicune.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "Many of its physical characteristics match those of a Virizion from the future that was covered in a paranormal magazine.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "According to the few eyewitness accounts that exist, it used its shining blades to julienne large trees and boulders.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "Dipplin is two creatures in one Pokémon. Its evolution was triggered by a special apple grown only in one place.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "The head sticking out belongs to the fore-wyrm, while the tail belongs to the core-wyrm. The two share one apple and help each other out.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "Supposedly, the regrets of a tea ceremony master who died before perfecting his craft lingered in some matcha and became a Pokémon.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Poltchageist looks like a regional form of Sinistea, but it was recently discovered that the two Pokémon are entirely unrelated.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "It pretends to be tea, trying to fool people into drinking it so it can drain their life-force. Its ruse is generally unsuccessful.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It prefers cool, dark places, such as the back of a shelf or the space beneath a home's floorboards. It wanders in search of prey after sunset.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "After all its muscles were stimulated by the toxic chain around its neck, Okidogi transformed and gained a powerful physique.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Okidogi is a ruffian with a short temper. It can pulverize anything by swinging around the chain on its neck.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "The chain is made from toxins that enhance capabilities. It stimulated Munkidori's brain and caused the Pokémon's psychic powers to bloom.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Munkidori keeps itself somewhere safe while it toys with its foes, using psychokinesis to induce intense dizziness.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "Fezandipiti owes its beautiful looks and lovely voice to the toxic stimulants emanating from the chain wrapped around its body.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Fezandipiti beats its glossy wings to scatter pheromones that captivate people and Pokémon.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "This Pokémon's type changes based on which mask it's wearing. It confounds its enemies with nimble movements and kicks.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "This mischief-loving Pokémon is full of curiosity. It battles by drawing out the type-based energy contained within its masks.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "It gathers static electricity from its surroundings. The beams it launches when down on all fours are tremendously powerful.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It digs holes on mountains, searching for food. It’s so durable that being caught in a cave-in won’t faze it.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "Seven syrpents live inside an apple made of syrup. The syrpent in the center is the commander.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "These capricious syrpents have banded together. On the rare occasion that their moods align, their true power is unleashed.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "There are scant few reports of this creature being sighted. One short video shows it rampaging and spouting pillars of flame.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It resembles an eerie Pokémon once shown in a paranormal magazine. That Pokémon was said to be an Entei regenerated from a fossil.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "It's said to incinerate everything around it with lightning launched from its fur. Very little is known about this creature.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It bears resemblance to a Pokémon that became a hot topic for a short while after a paranormal magazine touted it as Raikou's ancestor.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "It resembles a Pokémon described in a dubious magazine as a Terrakion that had been modified by an evil organization.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It was named after a mysterious object recorded in an old book. Its body seems to be metallic.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "It resembles a mysterious object introduced in a paranormal magazine as a cutting-edge weapon shaped like a Cobalion.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "There was supposedly an incident in which it launched shining blades to cut everything around it to pieces. Little else is known about it.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "Terapagos protects itself using its power to transform energy into hard crystals. This Pokémon is the source of the Terastal phenomenon.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It’s thought that this Pokémon lived in ancient Paldea until it got caught in seismic shifts and went extinct.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "It feeds others toxic mochi that draw out desires and capabilities. Those who eat the mochi fall under Pecharunt’s control, chained to its will.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "scarlet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/40/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Its peach-shaped shell serves as storage for a potent poison. It makes poisonous mochi and serves them to people and Pokémon.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "violet",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/41/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "The DNA of a space virus underwent a\nsudden mutation upon exposure to a\nlaser beam and resulted in DEOXYS.\fThe crystalline organ on this POKéMON’s\nchest appears to be its brain.",
