    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "When a school of Basculin appears in a lake,\neverything else disappears, except for Corphish\nand Crawdaunt. That’s how violent Basculin are.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
