[
  {
    "flavor_text": "Its quick movements confuse its enemies.\nWell equipped with claws and fangs, it also uses\nthe sharp rocks in its mane as weapons.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "sun",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "When properly raised from a young age, it will\nbecome a trustworthy partner that will\nabsolutely never betray its Trainer.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "moon",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "The sharp rocks in its mane can cut like knives.\nLycanroc wears its prey down by degrees\nbefore finishing them off.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "ultra-sun",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "The rocks in its mane are sharper than a knife.\nFragments that break off are treasured as\ngood luck charms.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "ultra-moon",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "This Lycanroc is calm and cautious. The rocks\njutting from its mane are razor sharp.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "sword",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "With swift movements, this Pokémon gradually\nbacks its prey into a corner. Lycanroc’s fangs are\nalways aimed toward opponents’ weak spots.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "shield",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "When it’s in trouble, its eyes moisten and begin\nto shine. The shining light attracts its comrades,\nand they stand together against their enemies.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "sun",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It’s awfully weak and notably tasty, so everyone\nis always out to get it. As it happens, anyone\ntrying to bully it receives a painful lesson.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "moon",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "They’re weak, so they move in schools.\nHowever, they can also often be seen all alone,\nhaving strayed from the school.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "ultra-sun",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "When it’s in a jam, its shining eyes attract\nothers of its kind. The light from its eyes is\nvisible almost 25 miles away.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "ultra-moon",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "Individually, they’re incredibly weak. It’s by\ngathering up into schools that they’re able\nto confront opponents.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "sword",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "When it senses danger, its eyes tear up.\nThe sparkle of its tears signals other\nWishiwashi to gather.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "shield",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
    "flavor_text": "It requires a lot of effort to maintain Lurantis’s\nvivid coloring, but some collectors enjoy this\nwork and treat it as their hobby.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "sun",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "It fires beams from its sickle-shaped petals.\nThese beams are powerful enough to cleave\nthrough thick metal plates.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "moon",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "For self-protection, it pretends to be a bug\nPokémon. Both of its arms bear\nkeen-edged petals.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "ultra-sun",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "As it slashes into its enemies, it looks like it’s\ndancing. Its elegant appearance has led some\nto call it the most glamorous Grass Pokémon.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "ultra-moon",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "This Pokémon resembles a beautiful flower.\nA properly raised Lurantis will have gorgeous,\nbrilliant colors.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "sword",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
    }
  },
  {
    "flavor_text": "The petals on this Pokémon’s arms are thin and\nsuper sharp, and they can fire laser beams if\nLurantis gathers light first.",
    "language": {
      "name": "en",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
    },
    "version": {
      "name": "shield",
      "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
    }
  }
]

[
  {
